4. Fully Functional Features
These features operate end-to-end without mocking:
Bilingual Switching (FA / EN):
Toggles state between 'en' and 'fa'.
Modifies document.documentElement.lang and document.documentElement.dir (ltr ↔ rtl).
Switches font family dynamically between Plus Jakarta Sans and Vazirmatn.
Updates document.title and all page strings via src/data/translations.ts.
Dark / Light Theme Toggle:
Toggles .dark and .light classes on document.documentElement.
Modifies CSS custom properties (--bg-main, --bg-card, --border-card, --color-text-main, etc.).
Terminal Code Copy Affordance:
Calls navigator.clipboard.writeText() with the Python code snippet.
Shows temporary "Copied!" checkmark feedback for 2000ms.
Interactive Modal Subsystem:
All 8 modals open and close cleanly without scroll lock leaks or DOM collisions.
Smooth Section Scrolling:
Clicking Projects or Skills navigates via scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' }).
CV Printing:
"Print / Save PDF" triggers window.print() with a tailored @media print CSS stylesheet.
Hover Tooltip Interactions:
Interactive bar chart hover states display commit numbers for any of the 16 bars.
Heatmap cells display dynamic tooltips on hover.
Tech stack badges show tooltips on hover.
Particle Canvas with Motion Preferences:
Automatically adapts particle count to viewport dimensions and stops completely when prefers-reduced-motion: reduce is enabled.
