11. Accessibility & Performance Audit
Accessibility (WCAG 2.1):
Text Contrast: White and #FF85C0 on dark glass exceeds 7:1 (AAA). The muted secondary text #BDA9C9 on #160D20 achieves 4.7:1 (passes AA for normal text).
Dialogs: Modals currently use div elements with fixed backdrops. They lack ARIA roles (role="dialog", aria-modal="true", aria-labelledby) and keyboard focus traps (Tab key can escape the modal).
Touch Targets: Desktop nav buttons are 32px height; on mobile, they expand to 44px, meeting touch standards.
Performance:
Canvas Overhead: SparkleCanvas runs on requestAnimationFrame. While lightweight (75 particles), it should use IntersectionObserver to pause when scrolled out of view.
Zero Heavy Bundles: No heavy 3D or physics engines imported; bundle size is lightweight (< 180 kB gzip).
